{"availability":"available","full":"caibinice/ai-quantitative-trading","name":"ai-quantitative-trading","description":"AI driven quantitative trading lab","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"TypeScript","stars":98,"forks":1,"created":"2026-07-16T14:05:57Z","updated":"2026-08-28T13:03:05Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"","topics":[],"demo":"https://caibinice.com/quant/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T21:33:22.672Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-05T21:33:22.672Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-05T21:33:22.672Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-05T21:33:22.672Z","stars":98,"forks":1}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["An end-to-end A-share research project for quantitative-finance beginners. It uses Tushare Pro as the primary source for structured market and financial data, supplements news and disclosures with AKShare, Eastmoney, and CNINFO, converts events into structured sentiment scores through an OpenAI-compatible LLM, and produces explainable stock rankings and strictly delayed historical backtests.","This project is for learning, research, and simulated backtesting only. It has no brokerage integration, never places real orders, and does not constitute investment advice.","The research overview brings the universe, market data, sentiment, AI coverage, rankings, and pipeline health into one auditable workspace."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/caibinice/ai-quantitative-trading/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"e3189e5bd7a4c2660012acd628e77477791fb6808fa0323b34fdbfd7613a2b24","extractedAt":"2026-10-05T21:33:22.836Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T21:33:22.836Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"An end-to-end A-share research project for quantitative-finance beginners. It uses Tushare Pro as the primary source for structured market and financial data, supplements news and disclosures with AKShare, Eastmoney, and CNINFO, converts events into structured sentiment scores through an OpenAI-compatible LLM, and produces explainable stock rankings and strictly delayed historical backtests.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/caibinice/ai-quantitative-trading/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"These are candidates for price-limit, capital-flow, dividend, and constituent modules, but they are not mixed into the ranking merely to increase the feature count. thsdaily requires more points, while news and annsd require separate permissions unavailable to the tested 2,000-point account.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/caibinice/ai-quantitative-trading/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"CNINFO is integrated through AKShare’s public wrapper and requires no additional account.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/caibinice/ai-quantitative-trading/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"The legacy GDELT DOC 2.0 full-text API requires no key, while the newer GDELT Cloud developer API requires an account and API key.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/caibinice/ai-quantitative-trading/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"e3189e5bd7a4c2660012acd628e77477791fb6808fa0323b34fdbfd7613a2b24","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/caibinice/ai-quantitative-trading/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-05T21:33:22.836Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-08-28T13:03:05Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/caibinice/ai-quantitative-trading/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-05T21:33:22.838Z","hash":"e3189e5bd7a4c2660012acd628e77477791fb6808fa0323b34fdbfd7613a2b24","originalBytes":31774,"storedBytes":31774,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["data","only","sentiment","api","stock","scripts","learning","llm","market","file","news","daily","mysql","project","research","run","disclosures","financial","index","database","password","quality","source","when","does","every","fallback","pwsh","f